# Per-topic permissions for a Mosquitto broker. tests/test_integration_auth.py loads this very file, so what is documented is what is tested.
#
# bridge: may write only the topics of device edge-1 (its measurements, status, info and stats). It cannot read anything.
user bridge
topic write edge/edge-1/#

# reader: may read the four topic kinds of any device and cannot publish at all.
user reader
topic read edge/+/mic
topic read edge/+/status
topic read edge/+/info
topic read edge/+/stats
